exports[`renderValidateReport() names the arguments terraform plans to change 1`] = `
"CONFIDENCE: approximate
  Intent changed. Each folder is planned on its own, against its dependencies' *last applied*
  outputs, so a cross-folder consequence of this change is invisible until apply, and a
  renamed producer's outputs are substituted from "mock_outputs". This report can both
  understate what apply will do and overstate drift.

INTENT CHANGES (octo resources)
  ~ @octo/dynamodb=dynamodb-table

INFRASTRUCTURE CHANGES (terraform)
  dynamodb-service-module
    ~ aws_dynamodb_table.dynamodb-table
        global_secondary_index.#: 0 → 1
        global_secondary_index.0.name: - → by-email
        read_capacity: 5 → (known after apply)

No drift detected."
`;

